# Ignore dataset blobs; keep the directory skeleton and the docs that describe it.
# Note: a bare `raw/**` also excludes the directories themselves, which stops git
# descending far enough to honour any negation below it — hence the explicit `!*/`
# re-includes for directories.
raw/**
processed/**
external/**

!raw/*/
!raw/*/*/
!processed/*/
!external/*/
!external/*/*/

!**/.gitkeep
!**/README.md
!dvc.yaml
